  <Strings>
    <Section>entry</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1404</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000055</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うーん!!
太陽さんさん気持ちいいぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahhh!! Senhor Sol, você
é fan~tás~tico!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1460</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000056</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんた、カレーズに入る前は
「暑いから氷出せ」って
言ってなかった？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Você não estava tão incomodada
com o calor antes de entrarmos
em Karez, a ponto de pedir gelo?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1500</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000057</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>過去に縛られちゃあダメだ。
未来に生きるんだ……&lt;Hilda&gt;。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não se prenda ao passado.
Viva pro futuro, &lt;Hilda&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1566</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000058</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うん、決まったぜ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É isso aí, mandei bem.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1602</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000059</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠を抜けるまで
まだ、かなりの距離がある。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ainda temos um bom caminho
até sair do deserto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1694</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>一気に突っ切るのは無理ね。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sim, atravessar tudo de uma
vez não é viável.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1739</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005b</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この近くに人が住んでいる
場所はないのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tem gente morando por perto?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005c</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>このあたりまで来たなら……
アニカマルっていう村があるわ。
もう少し先だったと思うけど。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Se avançamos o que penso, deve
haver uma vila por aqui,
chamada Anikamal. Acho que
fica um pouco mais à frente.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1831</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005d</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、そう遠くはないはずだ。
ここからだと、南の方角になる。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sim, não deve ser longe.
Basta seguirmos ao sul.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1906</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005e</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、そのアニカマルとやらで
ちょっくら休憩して、
後はバビログラードまで一直線だな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Beleza! A gente descansa
em Anikamal, ou sei lá como
chama, e vai direto pra
Babilograd!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1972</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900005f</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>早く行こッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vamos lá!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Annie&gt;!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Annie&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2241</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Annie&gt;!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Annie&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2257</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Annie&gt;!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Annie&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2395</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000064</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すごい熱だ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ela tá pegando fogo...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2435</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000065</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おい、&lt;Annie&gt;！
しっかりしろ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ei, &lt;Annie&gt;! Acorda!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2465</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000066</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この暑さのせいかしら……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Será que o calor afetou ela...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2508</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000067</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わからん……
とにかく、このままでは危険だ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Não sei... De todo modo,
não podemos deixá-la assim.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2545</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000068</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしよう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O que a gente faz?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2586</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>19000069</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アニカマルで医者を探そう。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Vamos achar um médico em Anikamal.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2629</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>1900006a</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>急ごう!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Precisamos nos apressar!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>2696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;&lt;scale:140&gt;&lt;speed:0&gt;&lt;font:80000002&gt;&lt;Annie&gt;が戦闘パーティから外れます。
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Annie&gt; não pode
participar de batalhas.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう……
助かったよ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Valeu pela ajuda.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>774</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうじゃ、これをお食べ。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tome, leve um pouco disto.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>798</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;『&lt;item:20000017&gt;』を食べました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Você comeu "&lt;item:20000017&gt;."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うまい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É gostoso...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おいしい!!
おいしいヨ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Que gostoso! É tão
mas tão delicioso!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うむ、これはうまい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm, está bom...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1073</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おいしい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>É delicioso...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1110</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くぅぅ、うめえ！
こいつぁ、五つ星だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uau, que delícia!
Dou cinco estrelas!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>0</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1147</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おいしいわね……
</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Estava delicioso...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>1173</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>853</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Green&gt;『&lt;item:20000017&gt;』のレシピを入手しました。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Green&gt;Você obteve a receita de "&lt;item:20000017&gt;"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
